[
{
"k": "5701",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{thinkingB}What is it?"
},
{
"k": "5702",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "This gun wasn't fired recently. Maybe a week ago. Or more.."
},
{
"k": "5703",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Yeah, the angle doesn't work."
},
{
"k": "5704",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Plausible."
},
{
"k": "5705",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "But why would I leave the gun?"
},
{
"k": "5706",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "His? Where'd he get it, I wonder..."
},
{
"k": "5707",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{thinkingA}Bullet passed through the chair."
},
{
"k": "5708",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Snow. Do me a favor. Stand over there."
},
{
"k": "5709",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Now aim your gun straight at the chair."
},
{
"k": "5710",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The angle is all wrong."
},
{
"k": "5711",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "So what happened?"
},
{
"k": "5712",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Shooter stood to the side"
},
{
"k": "5713",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I'm thinking the shooter stood off-center. Sent the bullet diagonally through. Probably there."
},
{
"k": "5714",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "It's a strange place to stand, if you're confronting someone with a gun. You know?"
},
{
"k": "5715",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Suicide?"
},
{
"k": "5716",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Not murder?"
},
{
"k": "5717",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "We'll see."
},
{
"k": "5718",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "So where's the knife?"
},
{
"k": "5719",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Self-inflicted"
},
{
"k": "5720",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Could be self-inflicted."
},
{
"k": "5721",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Not saying that just yet."
},
{
"k": "5722",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[shocked]Suicide?"
},
{
"k": "5723",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Bullet ricochet."
},
{
"k": "5724",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Bullets ricochet. Hard to tell exactly."
},
{
"k": "5725",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Well. Let me know..."
},
{
"k": "5726",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{thinkingB}[sigh]Yeah. The angle works if he {worriedA}shot himself."
},
{
"k": "5727",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[first half of his theory.]Shell could have ejected from that position..."
},
{
"k": "5728",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Or from right here."
},
{
"k": "5729",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Or fallen straight to the ground. From this chair."
},
{
"k": "5730",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[not entirely confident]I guess that lines up pretty well."
},
{
"k": "5731",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Probably where the shooter stood."
},
{
"k": "5732",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[confusion]I walk back into the kitchen to put the knife... away again?"
},
{
"k": "5733",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Must be from the first attempt, when he walked the knife back into the kitchen."
},
{
"k": "5734",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "How can you tell?"
},
{
"k": "5735",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Yeah. This would do it."
},
{
"k": "5736",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The hell? So who used the knife? Him or... someone else."
},
{
"k": "5737",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Smells like the blood from over there."
},
{
"k": "5738",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[calling]Bigby, hurry."
},
{
"k": "5739",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{confusedB}[amazed, not angry]Son of a ..."
},
{
"k": "5740",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1]Here. Like a crayon."
},
{
"k": "5741",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1]I might wreck it."
},
{
"k": "5742",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1]Thanks."
},
{
"k": "5743",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1][to Snow]You got a pencil?  I need to mark something."
},
{
"k": "5744",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I had a solid lead. It couldn't wait."
},
{
"k": "5745",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[hushed] What?"
},
{
"k": "5746",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{angryA}[hushed, to Lawrence] Are you expecting anyone?"
},
{
"k": "5747",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[hushed] What do I do?"
},
{
"k": "5748",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{surprisedA}[hushed] No. {thinkingB}Wait."
},
{
"k": "5749",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{doubtfulA}[hushed] I'll see who it is."
},
{
"k": "5750",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{thinkingC}[hushed] Just play dead."
},
{
"k": "5751",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[hushed] We need to know why whoever's out there is trying to break in. They may know something about your wife. Something going on here and you're part of it now."
},
{
"k": "5752",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{flusteredA}[hushed] I need your help."
},
{
"k": "5753",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{confusedB}[hushed] What?"
},
{
"k": "5754",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{worriedA}Trust me."
},
{
"k": "5755",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Terrible idea."
},
{
"k": "5756",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Snow, that's a terrible idea."
},
{
"k": "5757",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Let me handle this."
},
{
"k": "5758",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Snow, I can handle this."
},
{
"k": "5759",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You don't have to. I will."
},
{
"k": "5760",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Can I get the gun back? Just in case."
},
{
"k": "5761",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Where's my wife, you motherfucker!"
},
{
"k": "5762",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Hey, listen... you don't wanna do this, man."
},
{
"k": "5763",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "What did you do with my wife?"
},
{
"k": "5764",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I don't know what you're talkin' about, okay? I'm just a guy lookin' for answers too."
},
{
"k": "5765",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{angryB}Hey!"
},
{
"k": "5766",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Panel"
},
{
"k": "5767",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You don't have to apologize."
},
{
"k": "5768",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "First, you of all people shouldn't be using that phrase. Second, who said I couldn't handle him? It just would've been nice to have some backup. Sorry I asked. I won't next time."
},
{
"k": "5769",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{fearA}No. Leave it open- {flusteredA}leave it open..."
},
{
"k": "5770",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "This is bigger than I though it was."
},
{
"k": "5771",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The angle of the shot"
},
{
"k": "5772",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The pool of blood"
},
{
"k": "5773",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The suicide"
},
{
"k": "5774",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Shot yourself"
},
{
"k": "5775",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "It makes sense, I guess. The wrists and then he tried to finish himself off."
},
{
"k": "5776",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Someone else did"
},
{
"k": "5777",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "So, after he slashed his wrists, someone shot him? While kneeling?"
},
{
"k": "5778",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[drawn out, his dying breath] Faith."
},
{
"k": "5779",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "We need to find out what happened here."
},
{
"k": "5780",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I think I already know..."
},
{
"k": "5781",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "He killed himself..."
},
{
"k": "5782",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "He took his own life, Snow... probably found out about Faith."
},
{
"k": "5783",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "He was murdered..."
},
{
"k": "5784",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Someone killed him. I don't know why, but there's more to this than we're seeing."
},
{
"k": "5785",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "We should have come here first.."
},
{
"k": "5786",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[beat] Give me a minute look around."
},
{
"k": "5787",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "We were too late. I don't know exactly what happened, but his wound is recent... we could have stopped this."
},
{
"k": "5788",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Have a look around."
},
{
"k": "5789",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[lost] I didn't know Fables lived like this."
},
{
"k": "5790",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I'd feel better if we knew for sure."
},
{
"k": "5791",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "May I see it?"
},
{
"k": "5792",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Do you still have that letter?"
},
{
"k": "5793",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1]Judging from what I've seen here, I think I might already know the answer to this...  but..."
},
{
"k": "5794",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1] Wait! What are you doing?"
},
{
"k": "5795",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1] Where's the... you didn't get it?"
},
{
"k": "5796",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[open it yourself]"
},
{
"k": "5797",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[give it to Snow]"
},
{
"k": "5798",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[leave it on Lawrence's body]"
},
{
"k": "5799",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Tell her"
},
{
"k": "5800",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Let Snow read it"
},
{
"k": "5801",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "It wouldn't be right."
},
{
"k": "5802",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[we should keep it]"
},
{
"k": "5803",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[leave it with Lawrence]"
},
{
"k": "5804",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "yes"
},
{
"k": "5805",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I might still need it"
},
{
"k": "5806",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1] What did it say?"
},
{
"k": "5807",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1]I opened it."
},
{
"k": "5808",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1] \"I'm sorry... Faith.\""
},
{
"k": "5809",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1] Really..."
},
{
"k": "5810",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1] Thank you... at least... [exhale]I don't know..."
},
{
"k": "5811",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Here."
},
{
"k": "5812",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1] I wish he had known that."
},
{
"k": "5813",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "It wouldn't be right. If it wasn't evidence I wouldn't have looked at it myself. Sorry."
},
{
"k": "5814",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Sure... okay."
},
{
"k": "5815",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1] It wasn't meant for us."
},
{
"k": "5816",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup1] Of course."
},
{
"k": "5817",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The shooter bled out."
},
{
"k": "5818",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Suicide attempt."
},
{
"k": "5819",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "He stabbed someone."
},
{
"k": "5820",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{doubtfulA}Second-hand paperbacks.  Old encyclopedias."
},
{
"k": "5821",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{thinkingA}Dusty. No one's read these in awhile."
},
{
"k": "5822",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup]Bigby... Is there something I should know about, before we go in there?"
},
{
"k": "5823",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Let's focus on what we saw in the mirror."
},
{
"k": "5824",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "It's not that simple."
},
{
"k": "5825",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "We need to question Lawrence."
},
{
"k": "5826",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]{angryA}Hey!  Open up!"
},
{
"k": "5827",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]It's... [he hesitates yelling out 'The Sheriff']It's me."
},
{
"k": "5828",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]{angryA}Lawrence!  You {doubtfulA}in there?"
},
{
"k": "5829",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]Whoever did this... they might have killed Faith, too."
},
{
"k": "5830",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]Look at this... place.  I don't know what happened here, but none of it was good."
},
{
"k": "5831",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]Why? Out of guilt? [putting it together; emphasize 'he']You think he killed her?"
},
{
"k": "5832",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]Unless, Lawrence did this to himself."
},
{
"k": "5833",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]So now we know he shot himself.  Bullet passed diagonally thru his body.   And ended up in the wall.  Here."
},
{
"k": "5834",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]And the blood from the bed..."
},
{
"k": "5835",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]Is too old to be Faith's."
},
{
"k": "5836",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]That's the way it looks."
},
{
"k": "5837",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]So this is a suicide... not a murder."
},
{
"k": "5838",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]Okay... but what about Faith?  Did she... die here too?"
},
{
"k": "5839",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]And then he moved her?  I don't know.  I don't think so, but... we should look around."
},
{
"k": "5840",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5]They're all just slipping through cracks."
},
{
"k": "5841",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "A shell casing."
},
{
"k": "5842",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Seems to match the caliber of the gun on the floor."
},
{
"k": "5843",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[pickup5] {thinkingC}The knife doesn't really match the others."
},
{
"k": "5844",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
